        "original_id": "eded179e-5489-5a37-bc63-6dc2748c9638",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Coolio, Stevie Wonder\n- Products: Fantastic Voyage: The Greatest Hits, It Takes a Thief, Gangsta's Paradise, My Soul, Pastime Paradise, Curtain Falls\n- Topics: compilation albums, sampling\n\nFacts:\n- In 1976, Stevie Wonder released the song \"Pastime Paradise.\"\n- In 1995, Coolio released the hit \"Gangsta's Paradise,\" which sampled the chorus and instrumentation of Stevie Wonder's 1976 song \"Pastime Paradise.\"\n- Coolio's song \"Curtain Falls\" uses background music almost identical to \"Gangsta's Paradise\" because both songs use a sample of Stevie Wonder's \"Pastime Paradise.\"\n- In 2001, Coolio released \"Fantastic Voyage: The Greatest Hits\" as a compilation album.\n- Songs on \"Fantastic Voyage: The Greatest Hits\" originally appeared on Coolio's first three albums: \"It Takes a Thief,\" \"Gangsta's Paradise,\" and \"My Soul.\"",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "original_id": "62f9118f-5945-54b3-9306-eeff5558f071",
        "text": "Page: Fantastic Voyage: The Greatest Hits. Sentence: Fantastic Voyage: The Greatest Hits is a compilation album by rapper Coolio, released in 2001.\nPage: Fantastic Voyage: The Greatest Hits. Sentence: Other songs originally appear on his first three albums, \"It Takes a Thief\", \"Gangsta's Paradise\" and \"My Soul\".\nPage: Gangsta's Paradise. Sentence: It samples the chorus and instrumentation of Stevie Wonder's 1976 song \"Pastime Paradise\".\nPage: Curtain Falls. Sentence: The background music is almost identical to that of Coolio's 1995 hit, \"Gangsta's Paradise\", as they both share usage of a sample of Stevie Wonder's \"Pastime Paradise\".",
